The list of tools that need to be installed on the Sut
1- iproute2 >= 7.0 with SRv6 Mobile User Plane support (RFC 9433)
     The MUP behaviours (h_m_gtp4_d, end_m_gtp4_e, end_m_gtp6_d,
     end_m_gtp6_d_di, end_m_gtp6_e) require iproute2 with seg6 mobile
     uplane parsing -- the higebu/iproute2 b4/seg6-mobile branch, or
     iproute2-next once the series lands upstream.
2- Linux kernel with CONFIG_IPV6_SEG6_LWTUNNEL=y, plus the seg6 mobile
     uplane series in net/ipv6/seg6_local.c (the higebu/linux
     b4/seg6-mobile branch, or net-next once merged).
3- ethtool

The list of required configuration
1- disable Hyper-threading (bios)
2- disable irqbalance (sut.cfg)
3- disable NIC offloading features (sut.cfg)
